## Legal-domain entries for akana, in Zemberek's dictionary syntax. An entry here replaces a
## Zemberek entry with the same word, POS and secondary POS. Ref: gives the canonical lemma
## of a variant spelling (the root keeps the variant).

## Adjectives that akana-remove.dict drops as nouns.
idarî [P:Adj]
kanunî [P:Adj]
ihtiyatî [P:Adj]
tıbbî [P:Adj]
fizikî [P:Adj]
vicdanî [P:Adj]
hususî [P:Adj]
ziraî [P:Adj]
içtimaî [P:Adj]
hakikî [P:Adj]
ihtiyarî [P:Adj]
ulusal [P:Adj]
sulh [A:InverseHarmony, NoVoicing]
senil [P:Adj]

