## Abbreviations of statutes and courts, with the pronunciation that decides their suffixes
## (HMK'nın, AİHM'nin, İYUK'un). A statute is also read as its last word, Kanunu (HMK'nun,
## İİK'na), and AİHM/AİHS as written (AİHM'e, AİHS'in): Index:1 entries add that reading.
